    "text": "By SDF ,\n1 days ago Funding will expand access to veterinary care, animal-assisted therapy and wildlife education for Escondido residents. September 25, 2026 – Escondido, CA – Escondido residents will have greater access to veterinary care, therapeutic animal programs and educational experiences thanks to $183,000 in grants from Escondido Community Foundation (ECF), an affiliate of San Diego Foundation (SDF). Read full article",
